hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19310","Sufyan ibn Uyaynah narrated to us from Ismail, meaning Ibn Abi Khalid, from Hakim ibn Jabir from his father, he said: I entered upon the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, and with him was pumpkin, so I said: What is this? He said: We increase our food with it."
"19311","Waki narrated to us: Ismail ibn Abi Khalid narrated to us from Hakim ibn Jabir from his father, he said: I entered upon the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, in his house, and I saw with him gourd, so I said: O Messenger of Allah, what is this? He said: This is gourd with which we increase our food."
